# Keep the build context small and the image lean.
#
# NOTE: data/pages, data/sightline.db and the chunked Qdrant collection ARE included on
# purpose — the demo image serves real cited page images, so the corpus ships with it.
# What's excluded below is everything the champion retrieval config does not use.

# The late-interaction visual index (1.7 GB): implemented and measured, but NOT in the
# champion config (docs/RESULTS.md) — so it has no place in the serving image.
data/qdrant/collection/sightline_visual
# The unchunked baseline collection: only used by ablation configs, not by serving.
data/qdrant/collection/sightline_text
# Per-machine LLM response cache — must not leak into a public image.
data/llm_cache.db

# Secrets never enter the image; they arrive as runtime env vars.
.env

# Dev-only
.git
.github
.venv
venv
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
tests
docs
notebooks
*.md
!README.md
SIGHTLINE_BUILD_BIBLE.pdf
